    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/digital-online-courses/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Digital Online Courses theme is a cutting-edge, feature-rich, and user-friendly solution tailored for e-learning platforms, educational institutions, online academies, training centers, tutors, instructors, and e-learning coaches looking to deliver virtual education effectively. It's an excellent choice for online course creators, certification providers, universities, schools, colleges, corporate trainers, skill development platforms, and digital educators, accommodating various learning formats such as live sessions, video lectures, recorded tutorials, and interactive quizzes. With a responsive, SEO-optimized, and mobile-friendly design, this theme ensures seamless navigation and accessibility across all devices. It enables you to showcase course catalogs, student dashboards, progress tracking, instructor profiles, feedback systems, and assignment submissions with ease. Perfect for online universities, digital learning hubs, coding academies, language learning platforms, professional training institutes, and skill enhancement programs, its integration with the LearnPress plugin empowers educators to manage online courses, handle student enrollments, accept payments, and track learner performance efficiently. Additionally, it supports membership systems, payment gateways, and discussion forums to foster interactive learning communities. Featuring customizable layouts, vibrant visuals, call-to-action (CTA) buttons, and intuitive course grids, the theme offers an engaging learning experience. Whether you’re providing digital marketing training, coding lessons, creative design workshops, language tutoring, or corporate upskilling, the Digital Online Courses theme provides a professional, scalable, and conversion-driven platform that enables e-learning coaches to expand their online education businesses, boost student engagement, and streamline virtual teaching."
    },
